                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have played this game for several hours and I cannot finish any I start because of a constant crash which Stardock knows about and has not nor will they fix. Its very fun while it works. However once you get to a point in the game it freezes and CTD's or you have to close it down from task manager. I have wrote Stardock Support many times about this and each time they say we know and do nothing to fix it. Beware before you buy this. Some people have no problems and some do such as myself. You maybe unlucky like me.\n\nIf Stardock ever fixes this problem it would be a great game.",
